WEBVTT

00:04:28.076 --> 00:04:31.196
I want somebody to do,
like an investigative report, right?

00:04:31.196 --> 00:04:32.356
Because, you know,

00:04:32.396 --> 00:04:34.316
one of the interesting things in America

00:04:34.316 --> 00:04:37.076
is that we have these things
called time and leave studies.

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:41.396
So when the policy decision
was made to close schools,

00:04:41.436 --> 00:04:43.196
we had enough time,

00:04:43.196 --> 00:04:45.956
enough data to say,
well, who's doing the homeschooling?

00:04:45.996 --> 00:04:47.556
Who is this going to affect?

00:04:47.916 --> 00:04:50.396
What worker is this going to affect?

00:04:50.836 --> 00:04:53.356
And so we knew, policymakers knew

00:04:53.396 --> 00:04:59.116
that the ramifications of school closures
would dramatically affect women

00:04:59.156 --> 00:05:02.676
and it wouldn't touch,
as it didn't, men's labor.